<title>USA: Dime Bancorp Inc Q3 net eased.</title>
<headline>Dime Bancorp Inc Q3 net eased.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.16		    $0.17</p>
<p> Net			 16,894		   19,008</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 108,459		  109,943</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     108,561		  110,064</p>
<p>		     Nine Months</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.67		    $0.55</p>
<p> Net			 72,938		   59,852</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 109,193		  109,660</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     109,327		  109,810</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Net includes pretax loan loss provisions of 10.2 million vs 9.9 million in quarter and 31.0 million vs 29.7 million in nine months.</p>
<p>Net also includes restructuring and merger costs of nil vs $2.4 million in quarter and $3.5 million vs 5.6 million in nine months.</p>
<p>1996 net in both periods also includes Savings Association Insurance Fund recapitalization assessment of $26.3 million.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
